# Never let the host's node_modules into the image. Beyond bloating it, the
# native binaries in sharp / ffmpeg-static are built for the *host* platform
# (Windows or macOS here) and would overwrite the correct Linux ones that
# `npm ci --omit=dev` just installed — the classic "works on my machine,
# crashes in the container" failure.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Secrets must come from Cloud Run's environment/Secret Manager, never be
# baked into an image layer (anyone who can pull the image can read them).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
gcp-*.json
service-account*.json

# Not needed at runtime
.git/
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md
*.md
logs/
*.log
tmp/
.cache/
coverage/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
